mw2coop patch for maps/_intelligence.gsc (Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)

1. No intel pickups in a co-op campaign session. Which intel is found lives in each player's
   local profile (GetPlayerIntelIsFound); on the client the host's player is not local, the
   call raises a script error there only, and the two lockstep machines drift apart.
   Spec Ops removes intel the same way.
@@@ replace
	level.table_origins = create_array_of_origins_from_table();
	initialize_intel();
@@@ with
	level.table_origins = create_array_of_origins_from_table();

	if ( maps\_mw2coop::is_campaign_coop() )
	{
		remove_all_intel();
		return;
	}

	initialize_intel();
@@@ end
